'''White Cat''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 5.2 Update|Version 5.2]] and can be obtained by logging in during the [[Neo Mushroom Garden Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 279
|rarity = EX
|name1 = White Cat
|name2 = Gross White Cat
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Gross White Cat''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
White Cat, in first form, is a poor meatshield, and should not be used, provided you have [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Tank Cat]] or [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Tank Cat]]. In evolved form, Gross White Cat now has enough range to defeat the most basic of enemies (e.g. [[Hippoe]]/[[Gory]]). With that being said, even the lowest of Cats outclass it for pure, raw pushing power, as a 20+10 [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and a 20+10 [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] can both destroy enemies more efficiently. So, the most this Cat will contribute to your army is by helping you increase your [[User Rank]].

